[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12362.55, "timestamp": "03:26:02", "text": "哦，是的。这就是我们所在的地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12364.389, "timestamp": "03:26:04", "text": "等级提升。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12367.03, "timestamp": "03:26:07", "text": "是的。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12368.71, "timestamp": "03:26:08", "text": "怀旧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12371.67, "timestamp": "03:26:11", "text": "你知道，这有点吓人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12375.19, "timestamp": "03:26:15", "text": "想想看有没有洞。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12382.229, "timestamp": "03:26:22", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12384.63, "timestamp": "03:26:24", "text": "我想念这个地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12388.229, "timestamp": "03:26:28", "text": "这很有趣。一击。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12401.67, "timestamp": "03:26:41", "text": "这里是书店。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12404.07, "timestamp": "03:26:44", "text": "这些是书中的素材。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12406.79, "timestamp": "03:26:46", "text": "意思是，不是弹药，而是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12411.51, "timestamp": "03:26:51", "text": "青金石。拉皮斯有弹药。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12414.389, "timestamp": "03:26:54", "text": "你玩《狂热》玩得太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12418.63, "timestamp": "03:26:58", "text": "是的，我说过青金石那玩意儿有弹药，而且"}]